      "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-shattered-timelines-story-line-with-different-plot-lines-3898\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-shattered-timelines-story-line-with-different-plot-lines-3898</a></p><p>I only posted a few fights, but if you let me know the result of your first fight I can post the next fights for you. &nbsp;My whole Idea is one fight triggers the Shattering of timelines and the Heroes have to fix everything. &nbsp;The initial fight has 6 possible outcomes, and one involves the annihilation of Earth and all Humans. &nbsp;That's actually my favorite, the idea of trying to stop the destruction of everything with time travel appeals to me.</p>",
